---
title: "copySessionCookies (stem-system middleware.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_all: cookies = from.cookies.getAll()
    q_get_all --> q_iter: for cookie in cookies
    q_iter --> q_set: to.cookies.set(cookie.name, cookie.value)
    q_set --> q_iter: next cookie
    q_iter --> [*]: all cookies copied

    note right of q_iter
        INV-001: All session cookies from source response are copied to destination response
        INV-002: Refreshed tokens propagate to redirect responses preventing stale token usage
    end note
